 "_doc": "Merchant rules for the money lane (assistant/scripts/money/categorize.py). A transaction gets the FIRST rule whose `match` (case-insensitive regex on the bank description) fits; `sign` limits a rule to deposits (in) or charges (out); `account` limits it to accounts whose name matches. `bucket` must be a key of `buckets`. `learned` holds the rules the owner's typed answers on the weekly unknowns card produced (never hand-edit the ids; delete a row to unlearn). buckets: side business = Schedule C; `line` is the Schedule C line it feeds; `kind` income|expense|transfer|tax|ignore.",
